ird overtime, helping No. 10 BYU beat Kansas to keep its CFP hopes alive.","published":"2026-11-21T21:39:12.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50553754/byu-retains-cfp-hopes-beats-kansas-triple-over","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Nebraska snaps AP Top 25 losing skid, upsets Ohio State","description":"Nebraska broke its 31-game losing streak against AP Top 25 opponents with a 31-28 victory over No. 16 Ohio State on Saturday.","published":"2026-11-21T21:11:45.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50553426/nebraska-snaps-ap-top-25-losing-skid-upsets-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Nebraska's Matt Rhule ends his drought against ranked opponents","description":"Rhule and Nebraska brought an end to the Cornhuskers coach's infamous decade-long streak against Ohio State.","published":"2026-11-21T20:58:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50534102/nebraska-cornhuskers-matt-rhule-ranked-win-drought","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Syracuse QB Steve Angeli exits with injury, arm in sling","description":"Syracuse senior quarterback Steve Angeli left Saturday's game against Boston College with an injury to his throwing arm and will not return.","published":"2026-11-21T20:51:03.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50552810/syracuse-qb-steve-angeli-exits-injury-arm-sling","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Jake Trotter","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Week 12 live: Tracking top moments and best highlights","description":"Tracking the top plays and developments from Week 12.","published":"2026-11-21T18:35:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50541394/week-12-live-highlights","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Army pulls seating prank at Navy's football stadium ahead of Memphis game","description":"The letters were adjusted back in time for Navy's kickoff.","published":"2026-11-21T18:47:15.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50551457/army-navy-seat-prank","type":"Story","byline":"Associated Press","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Keisean Henderson leads Houston to win after QB Conner Weigman ruled out","description":"Houston ruled out starting QB Conner Weigman vs. West Virginia due to injury and instead went with true freshman Keisean Henderson, the No. 4 recruit for 2026.","published":"2026-11-21T21:38:48.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50550966/sources-houston-qb-conner-weigman-henderson-start","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-21T16:04:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-21T16:00:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Michigan starts QB Bryce Underwood vs. UCLA; Andrew Marsh suspended","description":"Michigan started QB Bryce Underwood over Tommy Carr, who had started the past four games. WR Andrew Marsh, meanwhile, is suspended for Saturday's game vs. UCLA.","published":"2026-11-21T20:46:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50549879/sources-michigan-expected-start-bryce-underwood-vs-ucla","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5081821/kenyatta-jackson-jr","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kenyatta_Jackson"},"pick":{"pick":53,"round":2,"team":"CLE","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Kenyatta Jackson","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kenyatta_Jackson","description":"American football player (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:36:39Z","intro":"Kenyatta Jackson Jr. (born February 11, 2004) is an American college football defensive end for the Ohio State Buckeyes.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Jackson attended Chaminade–Madonna College Preparatory School located in Hollywood, Florida. During his senior season, he totaled 55 tackles, 17 tackles for loss, 15 quarter back hurries and 14 sacks, where for his performance he was named the Florida Gatorade Player of the Year. Coming out of high school, Jackson was rated as a four-star recruit, the 7th overall defensive end, and the 78th overall player in the class of 2022, where he committed to play college football for the Ohio State Buckeyes over offers from other schools such as Alabama, Auburn, Clemson, Florida, Florida State, Georgia Tech, Miami, North Carolina, Nebraska, Oklahoma, Oregon, and Penn State."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Heading into his true freshman season in 2022, Jackson lost his black stripe before the start of the season, where he chose to wear the jersey #97, which Ohio State greats like Joey Bosa, Nick Bosa, and Cameron Heyward all wore. In his freshman season in 2022 he recorded just two tackles. During the 2023 season, Jackson notched seven tackles with two being for a loss and a sack and a half. He finished the 2024 season, playing in all 16 games, recording 15 tackles and a sack and a half, as he helped the Buckeyes win the 2025 National Championship."}]}}